    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.72,
      "end_seconds": 192.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.9,
      "end_seconds": 211.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Can you list what you take tablets creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.83,
      "end_seconds": 215.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.51,
      "end_seconds": 220.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "alright, over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.78,
      "end_seconds": 223.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.97,
      "end_seconds": 238.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Hip rotation is painful and limited and you have a limp favouring the right side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.78,
      "end_seconds": 247.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.38,
      "end_seconds": 272.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.13,
      "text": "I'll request an X-ray of the hips it'll help with hip pain. Use a walking stick in the left hand and do gentle strengthening exercises. The orthopaedic clinic would be the the right next step I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.61,
      "end_seconds": 275.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.15,
      "end_seconds": 287.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.81,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. Book a review in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.03,
      "end_seconds": 290.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.53,
      "end_seconds": 296.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
